<view class="page cards-page">
  <view class="cards-hero">
    <text class="hero-label">MEMBERSHIP</text>
    <text class="hero-title">一张好卡，养成训练习惯</text>
    <text class="hero-desc">当前门店：{{store.name}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="products">
    <view class="product card product-{{item.tone}}" wx:for="{{cards}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="selectCard" data-id="{{item.id}}">
      <view class="product-head">
        <text class="product-badge">{{item.badge}}</text>
        <text class="product-validity">{{item.validity}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="product-name">{{item.name}}</text>
      <text class="product-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
      <view class="product-bottom">
        <view>
          <text class="yen">¥</text><text class="product-price">{{item.price}}</text>
          <text class="original">¥{{item.originalPrice}}</text>
        </view>
        <button class="buy-btn" catchtap="buy" data-id="{{item.id}}">立即购买</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice card">
    <view class="notice-title">购卡须知</view>
    <view>1. 演示版支付仅写入本地订单，不会扣款。</view>
    <view>2. 月卡仅限当前门店使用，年卡支持全部门店。</view>
    <view>3. 正式上线需接入微信支付、退款与会员后台。</view>
  </view>
</view>
